Third-party data
----------------

src/data/sources.json
  Lists of social networks, search engines and AI assistants (host names), used to show a readable platform name
  ("Instagram") instead of a referrer host name ("l.instagram.com").
  Source:  https://github.com/matomo-org/searchengine-and-social-list
  Authors: the contributors of that list (maintained by the Matomo project)
  License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication), see the LICENSE file of that repository
  The file is rebuilt with `node scripts/update-sources.js`; its "_meta" block records the commit and the date.
  snar does not download anything at runtime.

src/data/sources-own.json
  Our own additions and renames, part of snar and under its license.
